    ["60装等竞技烙印装备自选箱"] = "Level 60 Competitive Brand Equipment Selection Box",
    ["<M_Default>亲爱的非凡者：</>\n<M_Default>恭喜您在神座之争玩法中跻身市排名前100，特赠荣誉头衔，可前往</><HyperLink stylename=\"M_Link\" u=\"jump=1250011\">【菜单-角色-头衔界面】</><M_Default>使用。</>"] = "<M_Default> Dear Beyonder: </>\n<M_Default> Congratulations on ranking in the top 100 in your city in the Battle for the Throne of God. You have been awarded an honorary title. You can go to </><HyperLink stylename=\"M_Link\" u=\"jump=1250011\"> [Menu - Character - Title Interface] </><M_Default> to use it. </>",
    ["<P_Heart>（充满向往）</>这种缝隙很奇妙，它藏在各种地方。"] = "<P_Heart> (Full of longing) </> This kind of gap is very wonderful, it hides in all sorts of places.",
