    ["“我们是一群时刻对抗着危险和疯狂的可怜虫，也是廷根的守护者。”"] = "\"We are a group of poor souls constantly fighting against danger and madness, and we are also the Guardians of Tingen.\"",
    ["“正义”小姐馈赠的精致钱包，能够带来潜意识和心灵的守护，抵御部分非凡伤害。但负面效果是……产生强烈的花钱冲动！"] = "An exquisite wallet gifted by Miss Justice, capable of bringing subconscious and spiritual protection, resisting some Beyonder damage. But the negative effect is... generating a strong urge to spend money!",
    ["……抱歉。"] = "……Sorry.",
    ["　　主教建议我种点水稻，早年她从精灵食谱中学过一种水稻做的美食，又甜又软，十分弹牙。\n\n\n　　种植培育记录就这样写好了：\n　　《“耕种者”途径对农田土壤肥力及作物生长的长期影响：以金秋湖地下遗迹的水稻种植为例》"] = "The Bishop suggested I plant some rice. Years ago, she learned a delicacy made of rice from an elf cookbook, which was sweet, soft, and very chewy. \n \n \n The planting and cultivation record is written like this: \n \"Long-term Effects of the 'Planter' Pathway on Farmland Soil Fertility and Crop Growth: A Case Study of Rice Planting in the Underground Ruins of Golden Autumn Lake\"",
    ["　　我用一瓶您给的牛奶换来了邻居家孩子的代笔。\n　　请原谅我如此冒昧，您的出现已经成了我每周里最期待的事——一位由香气构成的朋友。\n　　我不知道你的姓名，也永远不会知道你的模样，但我希望能有一个认识您的机会。\n\n　　若您愿意，下次来时，可否多停留片刻？让我给您一杯水，问问您的名字？"] = " I used a bottle of milk you gave me to get the neighbor's child to write this for me. \n Please forgive my presumption; your appearance has become the thing I look forward to most every week—a friend made of fragrance. \n I don't know your name, and I will never know your appearance, but I hope to have a chance to get to know you. \n\n If you are willing, could you stay a little longer next time you come? Let me offer you a glass of water and ask your name?",
